# Gate netd startup on BPF programs being loaded.
#
# On marlin with 4.4 kernel + 5.4 BPF backport, bpfloader takes ~30s to
# verify and JIT-compile all BPF programs. Upstream Android assumes
# bpfloader completes in <2s, so netd (class main, updatable) starts
# before bpf.progs_loaded is set. Without BPF maps, libnetd_updatable_init
# fails and netd exits.
#
# This override disables netd at boot and re-enables it once bpfloader
# has set bpf.progs_loaded=1.

on early-init
    stop netd

on property:bpf.progs_loaded=1
    enable netd
    start netd
